<title>USA: N.J. Educational Facilities Auth. issue repriced.</title>
<headline>N.J. Educational Facilities Auth. issue repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Tuesday it repriced a $20.7 million New Jersey Educational Facilities Authority Seton Hall University Project revenue refunding bond, 1996 Series, Project E issue.</p>
<p>The bonds are MBIA insured.</p>
</text>
